{"parse": {"title": "湖岸轻波-823601", "pageid": 136019, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"湖岸轻波\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/58/Item-823501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"湖岸轻波\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>湖岸轻波</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#823601</div></div><hr /><div>轻巧的箱子，内含一种未来。开启后可自选获得<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">十全调·【湖的涟漪】(限时)*1</span>或<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">灵魂压缩电池*1</span>。<br />若此道具过期时未使用此道具，此道具将在过期后自动转化为<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">灵魂压缩电池*1</span>。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">无论哪一条道路，都离你的朋友更近了一步。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">典藏吼吼光碟</td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/140121\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%85%A8%E8%B0%83%C2%B7%E3%80%90%E6%B9%96%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA%E3%80%91-140121\" title=\"十全调·【湖的涟漪】-140121\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%85%A8%E8%B0%83%C2%B7%E3%80%90%E6%B9%96%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA%E3%80%91-140121\" title=\"十全调·【湖的涟漪】\"><img alt=\"十全调·【湖的涟漪】\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Item-140101.png/100px-Item-140101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Item-140101.png/150px-Item-140101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Item-140101.png/200px-Item-140101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%85%A8%E8%B0%83%C2%B7%E3%80%90%E6%B9%96%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA%E3%80%91-140121\" title=\"十全调·【湖的涟漪】-140121\">十全调·【湖的涟漪】</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">各行其是的、拾全拾美的线，可在【湖的涟漪】征集中使纺车转动十周。<br /><span style=\"color:#AC5320\">仅限用于【湖的涟漪】中征集角色。</span>使用该道具时，若【湖的涟漪】首次征集折扣存在，将不会触发【湖的涟漪】首次征集折扣，该道具使用后，【湖的涟漪】首次征集折扣仍保留。【湖的涟漪】限时征集结束后，<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">该道具过期。</span></span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/770001\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0\" title=\"灵魂压缩电池\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0\" title=\"灵魂压缩电池\"><img alt=\"灵魂压缩电池\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Item-770001.png/100px-Item-770001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Item-770001.png/150px-Item-770001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Item-770001.png/200px-Item-770001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0\" title=\"灵魂压缩电池\">灵魂压缩电池</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">可用于开启所有<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">非具象留影仪</span>的灵魂压缩电池。消耗3颗<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">灵魂压缩电池</span>即可开启<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">非具象留影仪</span>，开启后可从指定范围中选择获取1个已拥有6星角色的造像。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "湖岸轻波"}}